  "subject": "feat(metal1): Route53 secret from Vault via ESO (Kubernetes auth) (#2028)",
  "body": "- external-secrets-operator: SA vault-auth (system:auth-delegator) and the vault-backend\n  ClusterSecretStore, logging in to vault.marthy.xyz at auth/kubernetes-metal1, role\n  external-secrets (policy external-secrets-metal1: read secret/cert-manager-pecs).\n- cert-manager-operator: ExternalSecret route53-awssecret replaces the hand-made Secret\n  (same key as Vault secret/cert-manager-pecs).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n"
